Package: pve-storage-quantastor
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
 perl,
 libpve-storage-perl,
 libwww-perl,
 liburi-perl,
 libjson-pp-perl | libjson-perl,
 open-iscsi
Description: QuantaStor storage plugin for Proxmox VE
 Integrates QuantaStor managed storage appliances as a first-class iSCSI
 block storage backend for Proxmox VE virtual machines and containers.
 .
 Registers storage type 'quantastor' with PVE. All volume management is
 performed via the QuantaStor REST API; iSCSI login and logout are handled
 locally via iscsiadm. No PVE core files are modified.
 .
 Supports: volume create/delete/resize, snapshots, rollback, template
 creation, and VM cloning from base images.
